$$
s[x_2 + 1][y_2 + 1] - s[x_2 + 1][y_1] - s[x_1][y_2 + 1] + s[x_1][y_1]
$$

In the initialization method, we preprocess the prefix sum array $s$, and in the query method, we directly return the result of the above formula.

